{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Error codes returned in detail.code by /api/scheduled-tasks* and by the schedule_task capability. The tasks page and chat card translate ui_codes (frontend/src/core/scheduled-tasks/errors.ts); agent_only_codes reach only the model.",
